---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="EUROCERT | Grievance Redressal"
  description="Submit a confidential grievance, complaint or suggestion to Eurocert. Appeals and redressal process."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/grievance/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[50vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368151/eurocert/l3.png.png" alt="Grievance Redressal" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16] via-[#030a16]/70 to-[#030a16]/40"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">We Listen</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Grievance <span class="text-eurogold-400">Redressal</span></h1><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-white/80 text-sm heading-font mt-4"><span class="text-white/70">Grievance</span></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Documents</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Complaint &amp; Appeals Documents</h2></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><a href="/q2%20(1).pdf" download="" class="group flex items-center gap-5 p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 hover:border-euro-600/30 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-red-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-red-100 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-file-pdf text-red-500 text-2xl"></i></div><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Complaint Appeals Document</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Eurocert S.A.</p></div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white text-euro-600 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-download text-sm"></i></div></a><a href="/q3.pdf" download="" class="group flex items-center gap-5 p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 hover:border-euro-600/30 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-red-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-red-100 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-file-pdf text-red-500 text-2xl"></i></div><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Complaint Appeal Document</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Eurocert Inspection</p></div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white text-euro-600 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-download text-sm"></i></div></a></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Report</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">Complaints / Suggestion / <span class="text-eurogold-400">Sensitive Issues</span></h2></div><p class="text-white/40 text-sm leading-relaxed">All complaints, suggestions and sensitive issues are handled confidentially and impartially. We are committed to resolving your concerns fairly and promptly.</p><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><p class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-eurogold-400 uppercase tracking-wider">It&#x27;s everyone&#x27;s responsibility to report a Grievance</p></div></div><div class="space-y-4 pt-2"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-phone text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><div><h5 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">India</h5><a href="tel:+919316012883" class="text-white/50 text-sm hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">+91 9316012883</a></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-phone text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><div><h5 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Greece</h5><a href="tel:+306978184999" class="text-white/50 text-sm hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">+30 697 818 4999</a></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-envelope text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><div><h5 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Email</h5><div class="space-y-2"><a href="mailto:eurocert.mv@gmail.com" class="block text-white/50 text-sm hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">eurocert.mv@gmail.com</a><a href="mailto:info@eurocert.in" class="block text-white/50 text-sm hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">info@eurocert.in</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-3"><div class="bg-white border border-white/10 shadow-[0_32px_80px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10"><form id="grievance-form" class="space-y-5" novalidate><input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Grievance Submitted via Website Form"/><input type="hidden" name="organization" value=""/><input type="hidden" name="anonymous" value="No"/><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div><label class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-3">Full Name <span class="text-red-400">*</span></label><input type="text" name="name" required="" class="form-input disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed" placeholder="Your full name" value=""/></div><div><label class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-3">Email Address <span class="text-red-400">*</span></label><input type="email" name="email" required="" class="form-input disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed" placeholder="your@email.com" value=""/></div></div><div><label class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-3">Phone Number</label><input type="tel" name="phone" class="form-input disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed" placeholder="+91 XXXXX XXXXX" value=""/></div><div><label class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-3">Complaints / Suggestion / Sensitive Issues <span class="text-red-400">*</span></label><textarea rows="4" name="message" required="" class="form-input" placeholder="Please describe your complaint, suggestion or sensitive issue in detail..."></textarea></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div><label class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-3">Report Category <span class="text-red-400">*</span></label><select name="category" class="form-input form-select-chevron"><option value="Quality Issue" selected="">Quality Issue</option><option value="Service Complaint">Service Complaint</option><option value="Certification Dispute">Certification Dispute</option><option value="Appeal">Appeal</option><option value="Sensitive Issue">Sensitive Issue</option><option value="Suggestion">Suggestion</option><option value="Other">Other</option></select></div><div><label class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-3">Anonymous</label><div class="flex items-center gap-3 h-[50px]"><button type="button" class="relative w-12 h-6 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-slate-200"><span class="absolute top-0.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white shadow transition-all duration-300 left-0.5"></span></button><span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">No</span></div></div></div><div><label class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-3">Add Evidence</label><div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-600/30 transition-all cursor-pointer bg-slate-50/50"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-cloud-upload-alt text-euro-600 text-sm"></i></div><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Click to upload file (PDF, Image, Document — max 500 KB)</p></div></div><input type="file" name="attachment" class="hidden" accept=".pdf,.doc,.docx,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif"/></div><button type="submit" id="gf-submit" class="w-full md:w-auto px-12 py-4 bg-euro-600 text-white heading-font text-xs font-bold rounded-2xl hover:bg-euro-700 transition shadow-2xl uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center justify-center gap-2 disabled:opacity-60"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane text-[10px]"></i>Submit Report</button></form><div id="gf-status" class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-center"></div><script>(function(){var APP_URL='https://damnart-ai-guladab.n8n-wsk.com/webhook/eurocert-vanshita-landing';var form=document.getElementById('grievance-form');var btn=document.getElementById('gf-submit');var status=document.getElementById('gf-status');var fileInput=form.querySelector('input[type=file]');function show(msg,ok){status.textContent=msg;status.style.color=ok?'#047857':'#dc2626';}form.addEventListener('submit',function(ev){ev.preventDefault();if(!form.name.value.trim()||!form.email.value.trim()||!form.message.value.trim()){show('Please fill in Name, Email and the grievance details.',false);return;}btn.disabled=true;btn.style.opacity=.5;show('Submitting...',true);var payload={'formType':'grievance','name':form.name.value.trim(),'email':form.email.value.trim(),'phone':form.phone.value.trim(),'organization':'','category':form.category.value,'subject':form.subject.value,'message':form.message.value.trim(),'anonymous':form.anonymous.value,'fileName':'','fileData':''};var file=fileInput&&fileInput.files[0];function send(){fetch(APP_URL,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'text/plain;charset=utf-8'},body:JSON.stringify(payload)}).then(function(r){return r.text().then(function(t){return {ok:r.ok,status:r.status,text:t};});}).then(function(res){var t=(res.text||'')+'';var ok=res.ok||res.status===200||t.indexOf('success')>-1;if(ok){btn.disabled=false;btn.style.opacity=1;show('Submitted successfully. Our Grievance team will contact you shortly.',true);form.reset();}else{show('Submission failed. Please try again.',false);}}).catch(function(){btn.disabled=false;btn.style.opacity=1;show('Network error. Please try again.',false);});}if(file){var reader=new FileReader();reader.onload=function(e){var parts=(e.target.result||'').split(',');payload.fileData=parts[1]||'';payload.fileName=file.name;send();};reader.onerror=function(){send();};reader.readAsDataURL(file);}else{send();}});})();</script></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Process</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Grievance Redressal Process</h2></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute left-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-euro-100 hidden md:block"></div><div class="space-y-6"><div class="flex gap-5 items-start md:pl-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-euro-50 border-2 border-euro-200 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 relative z-10"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs">01</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] flex-1 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Submit Grievance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Use the form below or email us with details of your concern. All submissions are treated confidentially.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-5 items-start md:pl-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-euro-50 border-2 border-euro-200 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 relative z-10"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs">02</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] flex-1 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Acknowledgement</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">We will acknowledge receipt of your grievance within 3 business days and assign a case number.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-5 items-start md:pl-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-euro-50 border-2 border-euro-200 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 relative z-10"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs">03</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] flex-1 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Investigation</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">An impartial review will be conducted by a designated team member who was not involved in the original matter.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-5 items-start md:pl-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-euro-50 border-2 border-euro-200 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 relative z-10"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs">04</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] flex-1 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Resolution</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">We will communicate the findings and proposed resolution within 30 business days of acknowledgement.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
